  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Access Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will increase energy access and renewable energy generation in the two islands of Espiritu Santo and Malekula, being second and third largest population centers after Efate. The project will assist Vanuatu install hydropower generation to replace diesel generation in Malekula and will extend the distribution grid in both Malekula and Espiritu Santo. Project preparatory technical assistance was used in project preparation.</narrative>
  </description>
