    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Brenwe Hydropower Plant put into operation by the government 
Indicator: 400 kilowatts hydropower generation constructed by 2023 
Progress/Status: The Brenwe hydropower plant was commissioned in Q4 2023. 
Data Source: Annual corporate report by utility concession holders 
