   <indicator measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2  Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Capacity building for project beneficiaries undertaken 
Indicator: 90% of VPMU staff to attend two separate annual training sessions on (i) gender awareness, HIV/AIDS-sexually transmitted diseases, and anti-sexual exploitation, abuse, and harassment in 2023; and (ii) gender dimension of energy in 2024 
Progress/Status: Ongoing. Trainings for VPMU conducted include (i) gender training awareness (in 2022), (ii) HIV/AIDS-STI training awareness, and (iii) SEAH (in 2023). 
Data Source: VPMU quarterly reports 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2017"></baseline>
