    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Capacity building for project beneficiaries undertaken 
Indicator: Ten training workshops conducted for newly connected households including power safety household utility budget and business skills training by 2026 
Progress/Status: VPMU has commenced providing training activities on budgeting and business skills training for households expected to be connected to the electricity grid. Some initial power safety awareness raising has been conducted and preparation for training for households is is planned in anticipation of households being connected. However, Output 3 can only be fully achieved when  the new households anticipated under Output 2 get connected. 
Data Source: VPMU quarterly reports 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
